    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "desc",
      "label": "Description",
      "default": "<p>The supplement industry replaced concentration with convenience, and function with flavor. Most products on market are diluted, sweetened, and dosed for label optics — not biological effect.</p><p>MYVOX-9 starts from a different premise: the body already knows how to regulate energy, stay resilient, and recover. The missing piece is input quality.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "btn_label",
      "label": "Button Label",
      "default": "OUR PHILOSOPHY"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "btn_link",
      "label": "Button Link"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Callout Badges"
    },
